bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
control ReplyService
entity ":CommentModel" as CommentModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open chapter comments
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /all-comment-chapter/{chapterId}
activate Router

Router -> CommentController: 3. Call get comment
activate CommentController

CommentController -> CommentController: 4. Check token
activate CommentController
space
deactivate CommentController

opt Token Invalid
    CommentController --> Router: 4.1. 401 Unauthorized
    Router --> UI: 4.2. Show error
    UI --> User: 4.3. Show error
end

CommentController -> CommentService: 5. Call get comment
activate CommentService

CommentService -> CommentModel: 6. Get comment
activate CommentModel
CommentModel --> CommentService: 7. Return comments
deactivate CommentModel

CommentService -> ReplyService: 8. Get reply count
activate ReplyService
ReplyService -> MongoDB: 9. Aggregate reply counts
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReplyService: 10. replyMap
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyService --> CommentService: 11. Reply count data
deactivate ReplyService

CommentService -> CommentService: 12. Merge replyCount & usernames
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

CommentService --> CommentController: 13. Return comments
deactivate CommentService

CommentController --> Router: 14. HTTP response
deactivate CommentController

Router --> UI: 15. Render comments
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 16. View comments
deactivate UI
deactivate User